# Copy to .env. Never commit .env, and never write a key into a tracked file.
#
# D-086: every path that points at generated output is ONE SETTING whose default is a
# gitignored folder inside this repository. Absolute, machine-specific defaults are what
# tests/no-absolute-paths.test.ts exists to catch.

# Where the pipeline writes stills, audio and video. Gitignored.
CUTROOM_ARTIFACTS_DIR=.artifacts

# The SQLite file (D-001). Gitignored.
CUTROOM_DB_PATH=./data/cutroom.sqlite

# Optional. A local checkout of the KnowScroll steering repository, so that
# `node scripts/decisions.mjs` can tell you when decisions exist there that have not been
# pushed yet — which no pin can see. Relative to this repository, or absolute; yours alone.
# CUTROOM_STEERING_DIR=../Knowscroll-v2

# No provider keys yet. When they arrive they live here and nowhere else, and only
# apps/worker ever reads them (D-005: the API never calls a provider).
